Also from EPQ, for computed k-factors (labelled unvalidated): SalvatXionA.csv,
SalvatXionB.csv and xionUis.csv (the Bote-Salvat inner-shell ionisation
cross-section coefficients and edge energies; EPQ's AbsoluteIonizationCrossSection.java
credits D. Bote, F. Salvat, A. Jablonski and C. J. Powell, September 2008, under the
same 17 USC 105 notice; Bote and Salvat, Phys. Rev. A 77, 042701 (2008); Bote et al.,
